  "description": "An always-learning neural concurrency tuner for EvalApp. A small holographic policy model (HoloFormer, d48/L2/K2/shifts8) replaces the built-in heuristic on your app's resource gates and keeps learning from its own decisions, so it re-converges when the best concurrency moves. Ships with a warm-start model, makes at most one decision per 25 ms, and keeps learning in production. Opt in with .WithNeuralTuning(), or pass in a model you own with .WithNeuralTuning(model).",
